{"results": [{"name": "Recess", "entity_id": "86C17C8B-54F8-40C6-9F87-26D4D4DEEA2D", "types": ["urn:entity:brand"], "properties": {"akas": [], "description": "Recess is a functional beverage brand designed to help consumers manage the stresses of modern, fast-paced life through magnesium and adaptogen-infused products. By bridging the gap between refreshing hydration and mood support, the brand offers sparkling waters, mocktails, and powders that provide a calm, clear, and collected feeling. It targets health-conscious adults who are looking for alcohol-free alternatives to unwind. With a strong direct-to-consumer model and an aesthetic rooted in serenity, the brand has carved out a unique space within the wellness and functional drink market.", "external": {"instagram": {"id": "takearecess"}, "twitter": {"id": "takearecess"}}, "founded_year": "2018", "image": {"url": "https://images.qloo.com/i/86C17C8B-54F8-40C6-9F87-26D4D4DEEA2D-420x-auto.jpg"}, "short_description": "Recess is a brand offering zero-proof craft mocktails and functional beverages infused with adaptogens and magnesium to promote calm and balance.", "short_descriptions": [{"language": "de", "value": "Eine Marke für funktionelle Getränke mit Magnesium und Adaptogenen, die Menschen dabei hilft, in ihrem hektischen Alltag Ruhe und Ausgeglichenheit zu finden."}, {"language": "fr", "value": "Une marque de boissons fonctionnelles infusées au magnésium et aux adaptogènes pour aider à retrouver calme et équilibre au quotidien."}, {"language": "es", "value": "Una marca de bebidas funcionales que elabora opciones con magnesio y adaptógenos para ayudar a las personas a encontrar calma y equilibrio en sus vidas agitadas."}, {"language": "en", "value": "A functional beverage brand crafting magnesium and adaptogen-infused drinks and powders to help people find calm and balance in their busy lives."}]}, "popularity": 0.808640301062874, "disambiguation": "", "tags": [{"name": "Candy & Confectionery", "tag_id": "urn:t